# Watchtower runtime configuration is managed from the in-app Settings page.
# This file is intentionally minimal.

# Optional only: override node binary for sidecar process spawn.
# NODE_BIN=node

# Optional fallback only: Codex GitHub token injection.
# Preferred auth is `gh auth login` or Codex GitHub MCP auth.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Model-id escape hatches (optional). Model id only — effort stays profile-
# defined. Read once at sidecar start; a change requires a restart. An id
# missing from sidecar/src/pricing/modelPrices.ts records NULL cost silently.
# Live backend (claude-code):
# WATCHTOWER_CLAUDE_LIGHTWEIGHT_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
# WATCHTOWER_CLAUDE_HIGH_REASONING_MODEL=claude-opus-5
# Codex backend:
# WATCHTOWER_LIGHTWEIGHT_CODEX_MODEL=gpt-5.2-codex
# WATCHTOWER_HIGH_REASONING_CODEX_MODEL=gpt-5.4
